            "message": "fix: make dynamic membership removal for OIDC case-insensitive (#14740)\n\nWith dynamic group mappings and dynamic membership removal enabled for\nOIDC, users currently get removed from teams in organizations that\ncontain upper-case letters, even though they should be added to those\nteams based on the group mappings. This is caused by the matching of\norganization names during the dynamic membership removal being\ncase-sensitive instead of being case-insensitive. Fix this by converting\nto case-insensitive matching.\n\nFixes #14739\n\nReviewed-on: https://codeberg.org/forgejo/forgejo/pulls/14740\nReviewed-by: Gusted <redacted@example.invalid>\n",
            "tree": {
